  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer HfO2/SiO2 alternating stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Initialize thicknesses from iteration_16 best candidate: [113.65, 61.50, 156.31, 62.55, 170.70, 58.41, 119.61, 64.73, 137.92, 56.84, 163.13, 65.05, 127.37, 60.87, 190.57, 63.37, 158.79, 62.54, 189.79, 64.87, 125.60, 68.59, 144.52, 46.09] nm. Apply gradient_thickness optimizer with 40% reduced step size relative to baseline. Add adjacency-smoothing penalty term that penalizes |thickness_H[i] - thickness_H[i+2]| for consecutive HfO2 layers. Evaluate over 300-1700 nm wavelength range with coherent smatrix solver. Maximize mean transmittance in 1000-1700 nm and mean reflectance in 300-450 nm simultaneously. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: low transmission in 300-450 nm; low reflection in 1000-1700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30; materials restricted to HfO2 and SiO2.",
